### Create User
POST http://localhost:8080/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Chico",
  "email": "chico@gmail.com",
  "password": "12345",
  "areaId": null,
  "roles": ["admin", "triator"]
}


### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "chico@gmail.com",
  "password": "12345"
}


### Select Role
POST http://localhost:8080/users/auth/select-role
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: auth_token={{cookieToken}}

{
  "role": "triator"
}

### Get Roles
GET http://localhost:8080/users/roles?email=chico@gmail.com
